                              {
                                "endTime" : 3363360000, 
                                "time" : 3363360000, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "Hello, I'm Armando Fox from UC Berkeley and today I have the pleasure of telling you about", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 7801290000, 
                                "time" : 7801290000, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "our experience bootstrapping a computer-based testing facility using shared lab space.", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 12126265200, 
                                "time" : 12126265200, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "I encourage you to read the paper if you are not familiar with the benefits of computer-based testing, but by computer-based", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 16475583600, 
                                "time" : 16475583600, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "testing facility, I'm talking about a facility for administering computer-based exams, whether they're manually", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 20853831600, 
                                "time" : 20853831600, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "graded or machine-graded, and a few of the important reasons to do this, which we discuss in the paper and I will", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 25095722400, 
                                "time" : 25095722400, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "not discuss further in this talk. The Proctors in our system are non-academic student workers, as opposed", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 29419462800, 
                                "time" : 29419462800, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "{\\rtf1\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\cocoartf2870\n\\cocoatextscaling0\\cocoaplatform0{\\fonttbl\\f0\\fswiss\\fcharset0 ArialMT;}\n{\\colortbl;\\red255\\green255\\blue255;\\red54\\green66\\blue74;}\n{\\*\\expandedcolortbl;;\\cssrgb\\c27451\\c32941\\c36078;}\n\\pard\\tx560\\tx1120\\tx1680\\tx2240\\tx2800\\tx3360\\tx3920\\tx4480\\tx5040\\tx5600\\tx6160\\tx6720\\pardirnatural\\partightenfactor0\n\n\\f0\\fs36 \\cf2 to instructors or teaching assistants. The facility is centrally managed with locked-down computers that}", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 33688431000, 
                                "time" : 33688431000, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "{\\rtf1\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\cocoartf2870\n\\cocoatextscaling0\\cocoaplatform0{\\fonttbl\\f0\\fswiss\\fcharset0 ArialMT;}\n{\\colortbl;\\red255\\green255\\blue255;\\red54\\green66\\blue74;}\n{\\*\\expandedcolortbl;;\\cssrgb\\c27451\\c32941\\c36078;}\n\\pard\\tx560\\tx1120\\tx1680\\tx2240\\tx2800\\tx3360\\tx3920\\tx4480\\tx5040\\tx5600\\tx6160\\tx6720\\pardirnatural\\partightenfactor0\n\n\\f0\\fs36 \\cf2 are connected permanently to our wired network. The exams are all fixed length, a uniform length of one hour}", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 38039954400, 
                                "time" : 38039954400, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "during the semester, or two hours during finals week, and taken over a two or typically three-day window,", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 42781321800, 
                                "time" : 42781321800, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "{\\rtf1\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\cocoartf2870\n\\cocoatextscaling0\\cocoaplatform0{\\fonttbl\\f0\\fswiss\\fcharset0 ArialMT;}\n{\\colortbl;\\red255\\green255\\blue255;\\red54\\green66\\blue74;}\n{\\*\\expandedcolortbl;;\\cssrgb\\c27451\\c32941\\c36078;}\n\\pard\\tx560\\tx1120\\tx1680\\tx2240\\tx2800\\tx3360\\tx3920\\tx4480\\tx5040\\tx5600\\tx6160\\tx6720\\pardirnatural\\partightenfactor0\n\n\\f0\\fs36 \\cf2 and we use PrairieLearn as the software for administering and authoring the exams. All of these}", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 47062197000, 
                                "time" : 47062197000, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "choices and important reasons why we chose them are justified in the paper. I'd like to", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 51312025800, 
                                "time" : 51312025800, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "{\\rtf1\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\cocoartf2870\n\\cocoatextscaling0\\cocoaplatform0{\\fonttbl\\f0\\fswiss\\fcharset0 ArialMT;}\n{\\colortbl;\\red255\\green255\\blue255;\\red54\\green66\\blue74;}\n{\\*\\expandedcolortbl;;\\cssrgb\\c27451\\c32941\\c36078;}\n\\pard\\tx560\\tx1120\\tx1680\\tx2240\\tx2800\\tx3360\\tx3920\\tx4480\\tx5040\\tx5600\\tx6160\\tx6720\\pardirnatural\\partightenfactor0\n\n\\f0\\fs36 \\cf2 give you two major takeaways from our work. The first is: probably no single unit at your institution}", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 55980892800, 
                                "time" : 55980892800, 
                                "value" : { "text" : "owns exam administration. Exam administration involves physical space, it involves proctors,", "textAttributes" : null }, 
                                "duration" : 0
                              }, 
                              {
                                "endTime" : 60264766800, 
                                "time" : 60264766800, 
